        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The best way to increase road transport safety is to make vehicle drivers take a driving test each year. To what extent do you agree or disagree?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdTodPP73oTL89xb06EllBIIggb\"><em><strong>The best way to increase road transport safety is to make vehicle drivers take a driving test each year. To what extent do you agree or disagree?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Annual Driving Test&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Snx2dJyWYo9gOOx73E6lL7xKgtf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Annual Driving Test&nbsp;cho 1 quan điểm:</strong> c&aacute;ch tốt nhất để đảm bảo an to&agrave;n giao th&ocirc;ng l&agrave; b&agrave;i thi s&aacute;t hạch hằng năm</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GEoSdInJYoSyNzx5YEolGcO8g3c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Bạn đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với &yacute; kiến n&agrave;y?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R78ddpIteoKgTix4dbllnf5Bg3g\">\n<div>\n<div>Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Annual Driving Test&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZgpEdncYro5sKSxMrIfl7WqZgsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GJXBdIVaSoywadxrneclJXbTgxh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HguPdoWeCoM1iLxbFVols5lCgTZ\"><em>(*) Bạn học&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>c&aacute;ch viết Introduction cho dạng To what extent</strong></span> ở đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;.</em></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KT7ede3NSo1ru4xpCIBl9UapgBh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BGGhdVmReo8crexGBfmlmwK6g5e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>implement sth <em>(thực thi...)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MHI1dJbsaooUWlx02MBlZZHfgtd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>enhance sth <em>(cải thiện...)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CYV9doU7loKGf4x8ICql3eoAgHh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n n&oacute;i r&otilde; quan điểm của m&igrave;nh l&agrave; đồng &yacute;, hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề. Ở đ&acirc;y, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm l&agrave; '<strong>đồng &yacute;'</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>b&agrave;i thi s&aacute;t hạch hằng năm sẽ gi&uacute;p t&agrave;i xế tham gia giao th&ocirc;ng an to&agrave;n hơn</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MLZsdj1enoZ3DhxLJmcleDs0gDf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lập luận theo <strong>c&aacute;ch 40/60 </strong>để l&agrave;m r&otilde; quan điểm tr&ecirc;n.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MYcJdNTueoQUDZxSXcglHf2igPr\"><em>(*) Bạn t&igrave;m hiểu về bản chất của <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> ở b&agrave;i học thử n&agrave;y nh&eacute;: <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=165\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic lập luận dạng 'To What Extent'</a></strong></span></em></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R7DBdGty2o8Jl0x7f7sloj7IgRZ\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OxcSdBlrBoSpGnx7WMvlcWnxggf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về một v&agrave;i điểm bất cập nhỏ của b&agrave;i thi s&aacute;t hạch hằng năm</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hmu5du8Z3olbFnx6BCdl0FjKgec\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng b&agrave;i thi n&agrave;y sẽ đem lại nhiều lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể về mặt an to&agrave;n giao th&ocirc;ng</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H8lIdpqAaoVmURxk7Nalv1W1gte\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H8lIdpqAaoVmURxk7Nalv1W1gte\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LPw9dKvFUoEWlRxjL0JlCQWZgNb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDljdX4xOotgANxTZYQlTHZjgRh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V8uydjoywoDQ8MxIljAlu4WkgKb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về một v&agrave;i điểm bất cập của b&agrave;i thi s&aacute;t hạch hằng năm</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, việc đi thi mỗi năm c&oacute; thể g&acirc;y ra một v&agrave;i kh&oacute; khăn</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HpC6dxUhIogdMPxgW12lDDHRgpc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea</strong>: Bất tiện cho những người <em>gặp kh&oacute; khăn trong việc c&acirc;n bằng kế hoạch c&aacute; nh&acirc;n</em>&nbsp;<em>(struggle to balance their professional and personal commitments).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ffc6dnORToVDaQx6t5QlGuaigyF\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Cần <em>nghỉ ph&eacute;p (take time off work)</em> để đi thi, ảnh hưởng tới <em>hiệu quả l&agrave;m việc</em> <em>(performance)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P9didt5uLol6TwxXFEdlKkIvgrh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea</strong>: Kh&oacute; khăn trong việc c&oacute; đủ <em>t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n cho k&igrave; thi</em> <em>(testing resources).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QDihdpcUuodfY9xNaz4ljZRDg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> C&aacute;c trung t&acirc;m tổ chức thi bị <em>qu&aacute; tải</em> <em>(overwhelmed)</em>, dẫn đến thời gian chờ v&agrave; <em>xử l&yacute; bị trễ nải</em>&nbsp;<em>(delayed processing time)</em>, đặc biệt l&agrave; ở v&ugrave;ng ngoại &ocirc; v&igrave; cơ sở vật chất kh&ocirc;ng đầy đủ.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng b&agrave;i thi n&agrave;y sẽ đem lại nhiều lợi &iacute;ch về mặt an to&agrave;n giao th&ocirc;ng</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin chắc rằng những c&aacute;i lợi m&agrave; k&igrave; thi n&agrave;y đem lại đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fz6yd7qTIoszoVxzg2HlB4BKg5f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea</strong>: Giảm tai nạn g&acirc;y ra bởi <em>t&agrave;i xế tự tin th&aacute;i qu&aacute;</em> <em>(overconfident drivers).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EanIdokicooJbJxyfHcluKePgag\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Hạn chế được<em> sự chủ quan</em> <em>(a false sense of security) </em>của t&agrave;i xế.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E0vXdxMiwoGnrixP0WClgjY8gRg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea</strong>: Đảm bảo tất cả t&agrave;i xế đều theo<em> ti&ecirc;u chuẩn mới nhất (consistent and up-to-date criteria)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FqWNdjksroBpxfx1n0PlrQBDgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Tạo ra <em>sự thống nhất về giao th&ocirc;ng (equal safety standards)</em>, đảm bảo được sự đồng nhất tr&igrave;nh độ của t&agrave;i xế.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt lại ngắn gọn c&aacute;c &yacute; đ&atilde; được thảo luận trong 2 đoạn BODY nh&eacute;.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VfQ3d5yCDoJva6xFyAmlDvTug7D\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V4NfdrOk5oGQY4xGjWaltRbvgUc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>annual driving assessments <em>(k&igrave; thi s&aacute;t hạch hằng năm)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rvxvd5RyMo6jFBxCmZ4lwWzfgLd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">to be justified by sth <em>(được l&yacute; giải bởi...)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 680,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FXk8dJu3AoGLlxx0IeMl3Vzxgqc\">Opinions are divided on whether implementing annual driving tests is the most effective measure to enhance road safety. Although this approach may pose certain challenges, I believe its benefits in promoting safer roads significantly outweigh the drawbacks.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14077,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 681,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAMJdi4X5oUhaPxGShzlCfM5gBb\">Admittedly, mandatory annual testing may create considerable difficulties for both drivers and testing facilities. <span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">Regarding individuals, taking driving tests on a yearly basis would be particularly inconvenient for working people who already struggle to balance their professional and personal commitments. Many would need to take time off work to attend these tests, potentially affecting their job performance and income.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, this policy would place significant strain on testing resources. The sudden increase in the number of annual tests would likely result in testing centers becoming overwhelmed, leading to extended waiting periods and delayed processing times, especially in rural areas where facilities are limited.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14077,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 682,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E5xZdskAZoirudxYSV8lpemqgYV\">However, these drawbacks are outweighed by the substantial benefits in terms of road safety. <span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">One significant advantage is that regular testing would help reduce accidents caused by overconfident drivers. When motorists are required to undergo periodic assessment, they are less likely to develop a false sense of security about their driving abilities. This system would encourage them to maintain alert and consistently practice safe driving habits, rather than becoming complacent over time.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, implementing a standardized safety assessment system nationwide would ensure that all drivers are evaluated using the consistent and up-to-date criteria. This uniformity would establish equal safety standards across all regions, ensuring that drivers throughout the country demonstrate the same level of competence and knowledge of traffic regulations.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14077,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 683,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kqt0dBthxoaIUExXYKAlo1pugDM\">In conclusion, while annual driving assessments may create some inconveniences for working individuals and strain testing resources, I believe these challenges are justified by the significant improvements in road safety through reduced accidents and standardized evaluation systems.</div>\n</div>",
